--- !u!102 &102731059169969419
TextMesh:
  serializedVersion: 3
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1976365255789935}
  m_Text: "2.复位按钮\r\n       当热继电器手动模式下，发生热过载动作后即\n使热元件冷却，触头开关也不会自动复位。须手动\n按下该按钮方可复位。设置手动模式可以提高系统\n安全性，方便故障排查。"
  m_OffsetZ: 0
  m_CharacterSize: 1
  m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Anchor: 3
  m_Alignment: 0
  m_TabSize: 4
  m_FontSize: 65
  m_FontStyle: 1
  m_RichText: 1
  m_Font: {fileID: 10102, guid: 0000000000000000e000000000000000, type: 0}
  m_Color:
    serializedVersion: 2
